  "definition": "Dental Hygienist Qualification in Specific Area",
  "effectiveDate": "2017-12-06",
  "historyNote": "#6909, eff 12-9-98; amd by #7270, eff 5-12-00; amd by #7778, eff 10-10-02; amd by #7818, eff 1-9-03; amd by #7929, eff 8-6-03; amd by #7970, eff 10-10-03; amd by #8100, eff 6-11-04; amd by #8260, eff 1-19-05; amd by #8584, eff 3-16-06; amd by #8694, eff 7-27-06; ss by #8838, eff 3-9-07; amd by #8963, eff 8-16-07; amd by #9256, eff 9-10-08; ss by 9408-B, eff 3-10-09; amd by #9778, eff 9-3-10; amd by #9973, eff 8-9-11; amd by #10328-B, eff 5-7-13; amd by #10437, eff 10-8-13; ss by #10689, eff 10-7-14; ss by #10991, eff 12-9-15; ss by #12428, eff 12-6-17",
